{"id":"vod_sn_36247","vodId":"36247","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"微笑闪士","name_cn":"微笑闪士","date":"2004-01-01","year":"2004","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/82eba49a794459b69827b1702198bfc9.jpg"},"summary":"所谓的闪士，是指擅长用鎗的武者。在战国世纪中，有位金发的天才少女闪士·天道琉朱菜靠着她手中的鎗和贫穷武士·虎岛弥次郎一边旅行一边混吃混喝…不！是维护正义！！哈哈哈～某天在路经太罗之国时，琉朱菜在外围的山谷发现了遍地的尸首，而且还遭受一个来路不明的铠甲人所攻击，琉朱菜因为子弹用尽而被打落山谷，事后才发现，攻击她的人竟是这个国家倍受人民敬重的国王！国王为了灭口，派了手下追杀琉朱菜，但却意外杀死无辜的人，琉朱菜一怒之下，竟决定直接杀上了王城…虽然有点秀逗兼脱线，但是坏人要是碰上她…啊哈！就准备乖乖的投降吧！！","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:41:34","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/H3eP6n5gYC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/AHPXtzUdcc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/FrFzLG4Fmr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/aFYCn6tUsy1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/i8dB4ASbFj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fMjUkjefdH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VNmenuddXP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/SDm1Ju3rii1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/aeeX8wmvwY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xU9CR3C38C1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/s2pG4LPgPd1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/B0q02ygACw1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:25.063Z"}